  "description": "✨ Cute Homework – Kawaii Puffy Stitch Bubble Font\nCute Homework is a super adorable, puffy handwritten bubble font with a sweet stitched/dashed outline look—perfect for creating playful, kid-friendly designs that instantly feel cheerful and cozy. Each letter is rounded, chunky, and easy to read, making it ideal for both big titles and fun everyday text.\nThis font is great for school-themed projects, kids branding, stickers, notebook covers, classroom worksheets, planners, and cute product packaging. The style pairs beautifully with pastel palettes, doodles, hearts, stars, and kawaii illustrations—just like your preview images.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>✨ Cute Homework – Kawaii Puffy Stitch Bubble Font</p>\n<p>Cute Homework is a super adorable, puffy handwritten bubble font with a sweet stitched/dashed outline look—perfect for creating playful, kid-friendly designs that instantly feel cheerful and cozy. Each letter is rounded, chunky, and easy to read, making it ideal for both big titles and fun everyday text.</p>\n<p>This font is great for school-themed projects, kids branding, stickers, notebook covers, classroom worksheets, planners, and cute product packaging. The style pairs beautifully with pastel palettes, doodles, hearts, stars, and kawaii illustrations—just like your preview images.</p>",
